Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 10:13:15 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(broadcast): send on SMS and Telegram; All farmers for
 the Communications Officer

The Broadcast screen showed SMS and Telegram as disabled boxes and offered
All farmers to every role, although in-app reaches agents only and the FSD
gives farmer broadcasts to the Communications Officer.

- SMS and Telegram boxes are live. In-app only to agents still goes to
  POST /notifications/broadcast, unchanged; any SMS or Telegram goes to
  POST /broadcasts (da_broadcast_channels): Telegram first, then the SMS
  copy to everyone not reached on Telegram.
- All farmers is offered to the Communications Officer and the Admin only,
  for a whole Region, Zone or Woreda.
- SMS part count follows OAN Messaging (70 characters per part with any
  Amharic letter, 153/67 per part beyond one, at most three). A warning
  shows when the SMS turns multi-part; Send is disabled beyond three.
  The preview and the Knowledge Base send dialog use the same count.
